{"id": "mbpp-103", "gold": "pass", "pred": "fail", "ok": false, "mode": "latent", "steps": 10, "answer": "```python\ndef eulerian_num(n, m):\n    if m < 0 or m > n:\n        return 0\n    a = [0] * (n + 1)\n    a[1] = 1\n    for i in range(2, n + 1):\n        for j in range(i):\n            a[i] += a[j] * ((i - j) ** (m - 1))\n    return a[m]\n```", "env": {"torch": "2.11.0+cu128", "transformers": "5.19.0", "device": "cuda", "python": "3.13.15"}, "seconds": 6.673947359000522, "tokens_written": 96, "latent_steps": 30, "fallbacks": 0, "run_id": "a02fe13565ee", "tainted": false, "outside_sources": [], "forced_text_handoffs": 0, "trace": [{"role": "planner", "mode": "latent", "text": "", "subtitle": null}, {"role": "critic", "mode": "latent", "text": "", "subtitle": null}, {"role": "refiner", "mode": "latent", "text": "", "subtitle": null}]}
