{"id": "mbpp-109", "gold": "pass", "pred": "fail", "ok": false, "mode": "latent", "steps": 10, "answer": "```python\ndef odd_Equivalent(binary_str, rotations):\n    def rotate(s, n):\n        return s[-n:] + s[:-n] if n != len(s) else s\n    def is_odd(s):\n        return int(s, 2) % 2 == 1\n    count = 0\n    for i in range(rotations):\n        rotated = rotate(binary_str + '0', i + 1)\n        if len(rotated) > 16 and is_odd(rotated):\n            count += 1\n    return count\n```", "env": {"torch": "2.11.0+cu128", "transformers": "5.19.0", "device": "cuda", "python": "3.13.15"}, "seconds": 7.847658901999239, "tokens_written": 116, "latent_steps": 30, "fallbacks": 0, "run_id": "b9ecad0fa407", "tainted": false, "outside_sources": [], "forced_text_handoffs": 0, "trace": [{"role": "planner", "mode": "latent", "text": "", "subtitle": null}, {"role": "critic", "mode": "latent", "text": "", "subtitle": null}, {"role": "refiner", "mode": "latent", "text": "", "subtitle": null}]}
